{"id":12752,"path":"/grammar-points/a2/purpose-to-for/","parentId":542,"order":45,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a2","depth":3,"title":"Expressing purpose with ‘to’ and ‘for’","seo":{"title":"Expressing purpose with 'to' and 'for' - Test-English","description":"Learn how to use 'to' and 'for' to talk about purpose in this A2 grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/A2Purpose_to-for.png"},"modified":"2026-02-19T12:10:50","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h2>Expressing purpose with <strong>to</strong> and <strong>for</strong></h2> <h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Complete the sentences below with <em>to</em> and <em>for</em>.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"604\"></div>","<h2>Expressing purpose with <strong>to</strong> and <strong>for</strong></h2> <h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct&nbsp;forms to express purpose.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"605\"></div>","<h2>Expressing purpose with <strong>to</strong> and <strong>for</strong></h2> <h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Fill in the gaps with <em>to</em> + infinitive, <em>for</em> + <em>-ing</em> or <em>for</em> + noun. In each gap, use <em>to</em> or <em>for</em> and the word/s in brackets.</h5> <p><em>EXAMPLE: I went to the shop <span class=\"textGap\">to buy</span> (buy) bread.</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"606\"></div> <p></p>"],"explanation":"<h2>Expressing purpose with <strong>to</strong> and <strong>for</strong></h2> <p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-29284\" src=\"/media/uploads/Purpose-to-for_Grammar-chart.webp\" alt=\"Grammar chart explaining the use of 'to' and 'for' for expressing purpose, with correct and incorrect example sentences.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <p>We can use <strong>to</strong> + infinitive and <strong>for</strong> + noun to talk about the purpose of an action or the reason why we do something.</p> <h3><strong>To</strong> + infinitive</h3> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I went to the grocery store <span><strong>to buy</strong></span> some vegetables.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>I studied hard <strong><span>to pass</span></strong> the exam.</em></li> </ul> <h3><strong>For</strong> + noun</h3> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Let’s go to the pub <span><strong>for</strong></span> a drink.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>We climbed to the top <span><strong>for</strong></span> the views.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Compare&nbsp;<strong>to</strong> vs&nbsp;<strong>for</strong></h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I went to the shop <span><strong>to buy</strong></span> some milk.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>I went to the shop <span><strong>for</strong></span> some milk.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <h3><strong>For</strong> + <strong>-ing</strong></h3> <h4>Don’t use <strong>for + -ing</strong> verb to talk about why we do something</h4> <p>We don’t use <strong>for</strong> + <strong>-ing</strong> verb to say what is the purpose of our actions, why we do something.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><span><em>I work hard <span><strong>for improving</strong></span> my English.</em><img src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/wrong.png\" hspace=\"5\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></li> <li><span><em>I work hard <span><strong>to improve</strong></span> my English.</em><img src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/correct.png\" hspace=\"5\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></li> <li><span><em>Turn the TV on <span><strong>for watching </strong></span>the news.</em><img src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/wrong.png\" hspace=\"5\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></li> <li><span><em>Turn the TV on <span><strong>to watch</strong></span> the news.</em><img src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/correct.png\" hspace=\"5\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></li> </ul> <h4>Use <strong>for + -ing</strong> verb to talk about the purpose or function of an object</h4> <p>We can use&nbsp;<strong>to&nbsp;</strong>+ infinitive or&nbsp;<strong>for + ing</strong> verb to talk about the purpose or function of a thing, what an object is used for.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>This machine is used <span><strong>for cleaning</strong></span> cars.</em></li> <li><em>This machine is used <span><strong>to clean</strong></span> cars.</em></li> <li><em>This is a special camera <strong><span>for photographing</span></strong> small objects.&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>This is a special camera <strong><span>to photograph</span></strong>&nbsp;small objects.&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":604,"questions":[{"id":5179,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I need my computer <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> send an important email. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["to","for"]}]},{"id":5180,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Call your doctor <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> an appointment. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["for","to"]}]},{"id":5181,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'm on a diet <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> lose some weight.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["for","to"]}]},{"id":5182,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'm going to call the restaurant <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> book a table. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["for","to"]}]},{"id":5183,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A thermometer is a tool <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> measuring the temperature. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["for","to"]}]},{"id":5184,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Do you have time <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a cup of tea?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["to","for"]}]},{"id":5185,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I need some money <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a taxi. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["for","to"]}]},{"id":5186,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I need some money <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> take a taxi. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["for","to"]}]},{"id":5187,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>This knife is used <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> cutting plastic. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["to","for"]}]},{"id":5188,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Where can I go <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> buy the ingredients?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["to","for"]}]}]},{"id":605,"questions":[{"id":5189,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>She's going to university _____ her studies. </div>","choices":[{"id":8129,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>for continuing</span>"},{"id":8130,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>for continue</span>"},{"id":8131,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>to continue</span>"}]},{"id":5190,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I need to buy a new dress _____.</div>","choices":[{"id":8132,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>to my next interview</span>"},{"id":8133,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>for my next interview</span>"},{"id":8134,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>for interviewing </span>"}]},{"id":5191,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Do you want to go to a coffee shop _____?</div>","choices":[{"id":8135,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>for breakfast</span>"},{"id":8136,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>to breakfast</span>"},{"id":8137,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>for having breakfast</span>"}]},{"id":5192,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Kitchen scissors are _____ foods. </div>","choices":[{"id":8138,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>for cutting</span>"},{"id":8139,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>to cutting</span>"},{"id":8140,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>for cut</span>"}]},{"id":5193,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I need to go home _____ my homework. </div>","choices":[{"id":8141,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>for finishing</span>"},{"id":8142,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>to finish</span>"},{"id":8143,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>for finish</span>"}]},{"id":5194,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>You must sign up _____ the site. </div>","choices":[{"id":8144,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>to use</span>"},{"id":8145,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>for use</span>"},{"id":8146,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>for using</span>"}]},{"id":5195,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I'm going to the post office _____.</div>","choices":[{"id":8147,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>for some stamps</span>"},{"id":8148,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>to some stamps</span>"},{"id":8149,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>for getting some stamps</span>"}]},{"id":5196,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>This tool is _____ cans easily.</div>","choices":[{"id":8150,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>for open</span>"},{"id":8151,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>for opening</span>"},{"id":8152,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>to opening</span>"}]},{"id":5197,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I needed to be alone _____.</div>","choices":[{"id":8153,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>for relax</span>"},{"id":8154,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>for relaxing</span>"},{"id":8155,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>to relax</span>"}]},{"id":5198,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>She called the police _____.</div>","choices":[{"id":8156,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>to helping</span>"},{"id":8157,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>for getting help</span>"},{"id":8158,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>for help</span>"}]}]},{"id":606,"questions":[{"id":5200,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I went to the shop <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (bread).</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5199,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>This app is used <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (find) new music.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5201,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I do exercise <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (reduce) stress. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5202,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I shop online <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (save) time.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5205,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>This park is the perfect place <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (picnics).</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5203,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>You can go to the library <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (find) articles for your project.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5204,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>They use social media <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (entertainment). </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5206,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A pen is <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (write).</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5207,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He studied a lot <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (get) good marks. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5208,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She worked very hard <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (a promotion). </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}